1. Separate files into forward and reverse
fasterq-dump --split-files SAMPLE

2. compress the output files
- gzip 
SAMPLE_1.fastq.gz and SAMPLE_1.fastq.gz

3. Evaluate the quality of the sequences
fastqc -j /usr/bin/java SAMPLE_1.fastq.gz -o directory
fastqc -j /usr/bin/java SAMPLE_2.fastq.gz -o directory

4. Clear readings
trim_galore --quality 30 --length 100 --stringency 5 --paired SAMPLE_1.fastq.gz  SAMPLE_2.fastq.gz

5. Coverage
samtools depth SAMPLE.sorted.bam | awk '{sum + = $3} END {print "Average= ", sum/NR}' 
